cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Mnema 1.0: Ferramenta educativa para organização e disponibilização de acervos históricos em Direito e violência de Estado"
abstract: >-
  Mnema 1.0 is an application developed at the Research Group on Law and State 
  Violence of FGV Law School São Paulo to rename digital files from the group’s 
  historical collections. Programmed in R (Shiny), it automates archival standardization 
  based on ISAD(G) and NOBRADE norms by generating batch renaming scripts (.bat), 
  and allows users to download structured datasets (.xlsx) for descriptive analysis.
authors:
